          "text": "🎁 Giveaway time!\nWe're picking 2 winners to win a Xiaomi Smart Band 11.\n\nTo support the Human x Car x Home ecosystem, we've built a clear brand structure.\nFirst we have Mi, our master brand, then we have our product sub-brands:\n- Xiaomi is for high-end, cutting-edge users.\n- REDMI is for young, trend-driven users.\n- POCO is for performance-driven users.\n- Mijia focuses on smart, human-centric living.\n- Cyber is for future exploration and bold tech.\nThird, we have Xiaomi MiMo, Xiaomi HyperAl, Xiaomi HyperOS, and Xiaomi XRING, which connect all our products together.\n\nHere's how to enter:\n- Follow us \n- Repost this\n- Reply with which brand you most want to see at IFA\n \n#Xiaomi #IFA2026 #HumanCarHome"
